EN:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Man, I think the saddest thing in the
world must be{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}when someone
