olviden de buscarte en el escondite.{{TAG:000B:0003:01CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}La cosa più triste del mondo è
quando{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} giochi a nascondino e
chi deve trovarti se lo dimentica!{{TAG:000B:0003:01CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Das Schrecklichste, was einem
beim Versteckspiel passieren kann,
ist{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} einfach vergessen zu werden.{{TAG:000B:0003:01CD}}
